                <note rend="inline" type="source">625.5131/97a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in Chile</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Philip</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-08-14T14:00:00-04:00">August 14, 1937—2
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>32. We are informed that the Franco-Chilean commercial convention of January 16,
                    1936, has received legislative approval in France. Without disclosing your
                    interest to the Foreign Office, please ascertain discreetly the legislative
                    status of the convention in Chile.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
